          ]
        },
        "150690101": {
          "id": 150690101,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 232,
          "text": "如果你收到这条定时短信，说明我的计划一定又又又出现了意外",
          "next": [
            150690102
          ]
        },
        "150690102": {
          "id": 150690102,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 232,
          "text": "当然，也不排除，你已经被星核炸上天，此时此刻，看到这条信息的是未来的我",
          "next": [
            150690103
          ]
        },
        "150690103": {
          "id": 150690103,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 232,
          "text": "但我猜，你的手机应该没这么好的质量",
          "next": [
            150690104,
            150690105
          ]
        },
        "150690104": {
          "id": 150690104,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "归寂？怎么又是你？",
          "next": [
            150690106
          ]
        },
        "150690105": {
          "id": 150690105,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "你的计划落空了，我们把你打败了！",
          "next": [
            150690106
          ]
        },
        "150690106": {
          "id": 150690106,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "【您联络的对象为空号，消息发送失败】",
          "next": [
            150690107
          ]
        },
        "150690107": {
          "id": 150690107,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 232,
          "text": "老实说，我并不抗拒这个剧情发展",
          "next": [
            150690108
          ]
        },
        "150690108": {
          "id": 150690108,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 232,
          "text": "相反，我很期待你们的胜利",
          "next": [
            150690109
          ]
        },
        "150690109": {
          "id": 150690109,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 232,
          "text": "这或许能证明我是错的",
          "next": [
            150690110
          ]
        },
        "150690110": {
          "id": 150690110,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 232,
          "text": "前提是，你们能通关这场游戏",
          "next": [
            150690111
          ]
        },
        "150690111": {
          "id": 150690111,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 232,
          "text": "无论赢的是谁，祂都会醒过来，把咱们一口吞掉",
          "next": [
            150690112,
            150690113
          ]
        },
        "150690112": {
          "id": 150690112,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "虽然你收不到信息，但…为什么要这么做？",
          "next": [
            150690114
          ]
        },
        "150690113": {
          "id": 150690113,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "你一定猜得到我想问什么",
          "next": [
            150690114
          ]
        },
        "150690114": {
          "id": 150690114,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "【您联络的对象为空号，消息发送失败】",
          "next": [
            150690115
          ]
        },
        "150690115": {
          "id": 150690115,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 232,
          "text": "哎呀…为什么要这么做呢？",
          "next": [
            150690116
          ]
        },
        "150690116": {
          "id": 150690116,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 232,
          "text": "既然阿哈躲在幕后，对世界的腐烂不管不问，那就由我代而为之，向宇宙发起挑战",
          "next": [
            150690117
          ]
        },
        "150690117": {
          "id": 150690117,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 232,
          "text": "而现在，新的挑战名为：打败复苏的「贪饕」",
          "next": [
            150690118
          ]
        },
        "150690118": {
          "id": 150690118,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 232,
          "text": "是一位英雄自毁灭中诞生，历经挑战、将真正的欢愉带回世间",
          "next": [
            150690119
          ]
        },
        "150690119": {
          "id": 150690119,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 232,
          "text": "还是野兽完成复仇，让欢愉在沦落至疯狂前迎来有尊严的灭亡",
          "next": [
            150690120
          ]
        },
        "150690120": {
          "id": 150690120,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 232,
          "text": "主角，你能为这个笑话，撰写更好的结局吗？",
          "next": []
        }
